  "details": "The accessory product page has very little information.\n\nFor example I learned from a youtube short that the Teddy Bear has adjustable arms and legs so you can make it hug your avatar.\n\nThe product page has no such information.\n\nSuch information is a very good selling point and these should be noted as bullet points (or \"technical information\" as we call it in e-commerce) to provide users more information and motivation to buy.\n\nOther bulletpoints should be all the other customisation options that are relevant (and especially those that are not clearly visible).",
